Modifications made in this repository:

  - The PyTorch weights were converted to the ggml format of whisper.cpp
    with models/convert-h5-to-ggml.py (whisper.cpp v1.9.2), the header
    field n_text_ctx being taken from max_target_positions (448). The
    resulting f16 file is byte-identical to the usual community conversion
    (sha256 aaebca10e2a65a6dda073a6b3ac59900f91887628acf872c565a0198ee850ead).
  - The f16 file was then quantized to q5_0 with whisper-quantize
    (whisper.cpp v1.9.2).

No weights were retrained or otherwise altered.
